[0.00622, "o", "\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[H─┫ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1m🍳 enplace\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;244m / \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;239mNo-Knead Sourdough Bread 🍞\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m ┣───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[2;1H\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1mNo-Knead Sourdough Bread\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                          \u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;244mPrep 20m  ·  Cook 1h  ·  Serves 1 loaves\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;244mHydration \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;107m██\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;101m████\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;137m████\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;136m█▌\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;145m░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1m 69.8%\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;244m  ·  1242g dough\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;244m(100% hydration starter assumed)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[48;5;167m \u001b[38;5;231m🍞 bread/dough\u001b[39m \u001b[49m \u001b[48;5;167m \u001b[38;5;231mbreakfast\u001b[39m \u001b[49m \u001b[48;5;167m \u001b[38;5;231mlunch\u001b[39m \u001b[49m \u001b[48;5;107m \u001b[38;5;231mbake\u001b[39m \u001b[49m \u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[7mA crusty, chewy sourdough bread with robust flavor and rich golden color, made entirely with\u001b(B\u001b[m      \u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[7msourdough starter for leavening. Requires minimal effort with no kneading, just folding and a long\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[7mcold fermentation, resulting in a stunning, delicious loaf.\u001b(B\u001b[m                                       \u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n─┤ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;107m\u001b[1mIngredients\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  · \u001b[39m227 g sourdough starter, ripe, fed\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  · \u001b[39m397 g water, lukewarm\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  · \u001b[39m600 g bread flour\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  · \u001b[39m18 g salt\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  · \u001b[39m2 tsp diastatic malt powder, optional\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n─┤ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;107m\u001b[1mDirections\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;252m ├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m                                                                                                \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m1. In a large mixing bowl or 6-quart food-safe plastic bucket, combine the sourdough starter,   \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mwater, bread flour, salt, and diastatic malt powder (if using).                                 \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m2. Mix and stir everything together to make a sticky, rough dough. If using a stand mixer, beat \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mat medium speed with the paddle attachment for 30 to 60 seconds; if not, stir with a large spoon\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mor dough whisk until everything is combined.                                                    \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m3. Cover the bucket or bowl with a lid or plastic wrap and let the dough rise for 1 hour.       \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m4. Gently pick up the dough and fold it over on itself several times, cover it again, and let it\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mrise for another hour.                                                                          \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m5. Repeat the rising-folding process one more time (for a total of 3 hours), folding after the  \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mlast hour. Then place the bucket or bowl in the refrigerator and let the dough rest for at least\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m8 hours or up to 48 hours.                                                                      \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m6. Turn the dough out onto a well-floured work surface and shape it into a rough ball. Leave the\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mdough s"]
[0.00624, "o", "eam-side up, cover it, and let it rest on a floured surface for 15 minutes.              \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m7. Shape the dough to fit your baking vessel: a 13\" log for a 13\" pain de mie pan or long       \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mcovered baker, or a large round boule for a round baker or Dutch oven. Lightly grease the inside\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mof your baker, dust the inside with semolina, or place the dough on a sheet of parchment. Place \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234mthe shaped dough in the baker (along with parchment if using) and cover it with the lid.        \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[38;5;234m8. Let the loaf warm to room temperature and rise for about 2 1/2 to 3 hours. The loaf will     \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;252m\r\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;244m\r\n  \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1m↑/↓\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mscroll\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1mh\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mhome\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1me\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244medit\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1ms\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mscale\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1mp\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mexport\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1md\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mdelete\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1mr\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mrate\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1mN\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[38;5;244mnotes\u001b[39m                                                          \u001b[38;5;145menplace 1.3.0-alpha\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?1006l\u001b[?1000l\u001b[?1002l\u001b[?1003l\u001b[1;1H\u001b[1;45r\u001b[?25l\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b[1;1H─┫ \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;167m\u001b[1m🍳 enplace\u001b(B\u001b[m\